---
import type { Props, Input, Output } from '../.atomic/types/assess-change';
import type { AtomConfig } from '../.atomic/types/authoring';
const { input }: Props = Astro.props;
export const config: AtomConfig<Input, Output> = {
  "description": "Summarize the supplied billing change and flag uncertainty."
};
---

Summarize the billing change in one sentence. Set needs_human to true when
     the change affects money or policy, or when its effect is uncertain.

     Change: {input.change}
